o也是第一次拿到的蜜处理批次，特别的莓果、葡萄、柚子，甜感刚刚的\n          </strong>\n          ～\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          厄瓜多尔这只竞拍豆是年初就确定了的，总算等到它了，相比现在在售的厄瓜多尔瑰夏的柑橘调性，这一支会更红色莓果和葡萄一些，这几天陆续测了几次，甜就一个字，\n          <strong style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n           为啥厄瓜多尔的豆子都那么甜呢～NO SUGAR，伙伴们\n          </strong>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SWojLYMS4Jbv7nCTXWh09tCjYibgEMcx3em4rL461q6xvib04XvoKakfWYLbK2yR9VXtvUmnbOiaBNw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;visibility: visible !important;width: 676px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 12px;\">\n            新版本的100g没有老的这么闪了，低调内敛了一些～哈哈\n           </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\